**OL2**
Example:
```json
{
	"condition": "some condition",
	"label": "Label",
	"normal": {
		"iconSrc": "img/marker/globe.svg",
		"width": 24,
		"height": 24
	},
	"hovered": {
		"iconSrc": "img/marker/citadel.png",
		"width": 24,
		"height": 24
	},
	"selected": {
		"iconSrc": "img/marker/tower.png",
		"width": 24,
		"height": 24
	},
	"found": {
		"iconSrc": "img/marker/tower.png",
		"width": 24,
		"height": 24
	}
}
```

**OL6**
Example:
```json
{
	"condition": "true",
	"normal": {
		"iconSrc": "img/marker/citadel.png",
		"scale": [0.05, 0.05],
		"iconColor": "#BADA55"
	},
	"selected": {
		"iconSrc": "img/marker/tower-icon.svg",
		"scale": [0.1, 0.1],
		"iconColor": "#BADA55"
	},
	"hovered": {
		"iconSrc": "img/marker/tower.png",
		"scale": [0.05, 0.05],
